  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - 1986 meltdown hid Pripyat secret labs. Something escaped - intelligent, mimics
    humans.
  - Burn the infected mushrooms in the greenhouse. Use wood you scavenge to feed
    the fire.
  - Scavengers roam the zone. If they see you, they will not hesitate.
  - Collect food cans from the abandoned homes and bring them to the church for the
    survivors.
  - And remember... one of your squad might not be who they look like.
  animator: {fileID: 3971455369552112223}
  talkTrigger: talking
